---
permalink: /_redirects.json
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- Every redirect page this build writes (room-legacy.njk), path to target: the legacy
    /room/<Room-ID>-<name>/ routes and the room route aliases (src/_data/legacyRooms.js). Each deploy
    copies this map into CloudFront's key value store and the viewer-request function answers these
    paths with a 301 (infra/viewer-request.mjs), so the pages themselves are never reached; they stay
    as the map's source of truth. The deploy does not publish this file, and an e2e test keeps it
    equal to the pages. -#}
{
{%- for redirect in legacyRooms %}
  {{ ("/room/" + redirect.from + "/") | dump | safe }}: {{ (redirect.room | roomPath) | dump | safe }}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
}
